    "detailed_description": "Summon: Joint Escape is a cooperative horror survival game for 1-4 players. Find a way to escape from a stalker in camouflage uniform who wants to give you a piece of paper with the inscription &quot;Summon&quot;. <br><br>The main genres of the game are horror, memes, action, co-op.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Is Special About This Game?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> A post-Soviet style game space.<br></li><li> Smart artificial intelligence.<br></li><li> The rage and speed of the opponents increases as the game progresses.<br></li><li> Random object generation makes each game unique.<br></li><li> You can fight with the local gangsters.<br></li><li> Cooperative and single player mode.</li></ul><br>The game is a fiction and has nothing to do with reality, any coincidences with real events or personalities are completely random. The game features a fictional world. The game does not call anyone to anything, does not promote anything, and also does not aim to offend or humiliate anyone.",
